In all other respects, the judgment and award of the Sri Jayarama Shetty vs Sri Aneesh K J on 13 February, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/168053456/
5 Tribunal shall remain unaltered;
iii) The appellant/claimant is entitled to a total compensation of `1,56,000/- together with interest at 6% per annum from the date of petition till its realization.
iv) Respondent No.3/Insurance Company is directed to deposit the balance of the said compensation together with accrued - 12 - NC: 2024:KHC:6042 interest within a period of eight weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this judgment;
